# L §5.11 Law changes are additions: "the def's rules may also come from a version item `replace rule x.L` naming a new
# label, which adds it" (a new exception from that version's governs).  From 2026-07 rule extra (beats base)
# exists and applies: 2; before, only base: 1.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"

def x: int at reader
  rule base = 0

version v
  cite s
  governs 2026-07..
  known 2026-06-01
  replace rule x.extra beats base = 1

ask q1: x law 2026-03-01
ask q2: x law 2026-08-01
=== expect
q1: 0
  law date 2026-03-01, cut 2026-12-31
q2: 1
  law date 2026-08-01, cut 2026-12-31
